WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.514
Video 25. Screen ni bhaasha, ane phonetic
typing.

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:09.498
Ctrl+K thi screen ni bhaasha badlaay chhe.

00:00:09.428 --> 00:00:12.955
Ctrl+W thi typing ni bhaasha badlaay chhe.

00:00:12.884 --> 00:00:16.310
Tamaro data ane keys e j rahe chhe.

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:26.045
Ctrl+K thi list khule chhe. Hindi ane Gujarati
poori chhe. Beeji 8 bhaasha beta ma chhe.

00:00:26.075 --> 00:00:32.355
Hindi type karo, ane Enter dabaavo. Have darek
screen Hindi ma chhe.

00:00:33.475 --> 00:00:38.367
Keys e j rahe chhe. B thi haji Balance Sheet
khule chhe.

00:00:39.447 --> 00:00:45.106
Fari Ctrl+K. Gujarati type karo, ane Enter
dabaavo.

00:00:45.805 --> 00:00:52.423
Alt+Y thi haji Data menu khule chhe. Tamaro
data e j rahe chhe.

00:00:53.503 --> 00:01:01.617
Navi screen bhaasha typing ni bhaasha pan set kare
chhe. Ahi aapne ek ledger banaaviye chhiye.

00:01:01.647 --> 00:01:08.885
Naam no uchchaar English aksharo ma type karo.
Hisaab ene Gujarati ma lakhe chhe.

00:01:08.915 --> 00:01:14.705
Ctrl+W fakt typing ni bhaasha badle chhe,
daakhla tarike English ma.

00:01:15.785 --> 00:01:20.528
Ctrl+K ane English thi angreji screens paachhi
aave chhe.

00:01:22.127 --> 00:01:26.935
Tamari potani bhaasha ma kaam karo. Keys e j
rahe chhe.

00:01:26.865 --> 00:01:31.758
Have pachhi: Hisaab Docs bill vaanchine
voucher banaave chhe.

